Scaffold, not built (round 22). Rootless, daemonless containers for distrobox.

Needs, none of them packaged yet:
  podman (Go), conmon (C), crun (C, needs libcap libseccomp yajl), netavark + aardvark-dns (Rust) or
  just passt/pasta for rootless networking, fuse-overlayfs (C; the kernel's overlayfs works rootless
  from 5.11 on, so it is optional), shadow's newuidmap/newgidmap (setuid, in the shadow package),
  slirp4netns (optional with pasta), containers-common config (policy.json, registries.conf).
Kernel: done in round 22 (config/kernel/freelfs.config): user namespaces, cgroup v2 + memcg + BPF
device controller, TUN, veth, bridge, nftables with NAT/masquerade, overlayfs, FUSE.
Sub-IDs: /etc/subuid and /etc/subgid need a range per user (the installer / first login should add
100000:65536; the live tester too). rc.sysinit/useradd skel: `touch /etc/subuid /etc/subgid` exists.
Runtime: no daemon; podman starts per command. Idle RAM: unchanged (nothing resident).
Build order: crun, conmon, passt, podman (needs Go: the Go toolchain is not in the image build yet),
then flpkg install podman distrobox. The recipe has to set CONTAINERS_CONF paths to /etc/containers.
